3. **`.claude/docs/stack.md` — the five versions re-derived.** Copy the live file to
   `.andromeda/cache/chunks/2026-11-20-readme-and-records/evidence/stack.md` and edit the copy:
   - line 15: `selectors 0.41.0` → `selectors 0.43.0`;
   - line 18: `skrifa 0.44` → `skrifa 0.49`;
   - line 20: `usvg 0.48.1` → `usvg 0.50.0`, `svgtypes 0.16.1` → `svgtypes 0.16.2`;
   - line 21: `arboard 3.4.1, ` removed, and `clipboard text through winit` placed where it stood. The word `arboard` does not stay in the file.
   Each new value is the root `Cargo.toml` pin (`Cargo.toml:72`, `:118`, `:139`, `:140`; arboard is in no manifest
   and not in `Cargo.lock`). No other line changes. Land the copy with
   `python -X utf8 ~/.claude/skills/andromeda-tools/scripts/rec.py harness land --root . .claude/docs/stack.md --file .andromeda/cache/chunks/2026-11-20-readme-and-records/evidence/stack.md`,
   first with `--dry-run`, then for real. The live file is never hand-edited.
